{"name": "Assembly Run", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assembly Run is a fast roguelike shooter for 1\u20134 players, set in a miniature toy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight through changing rooms, find new gear, and build a weapon that gets stronger as the run goes on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964490/extras/db5055bc3cdb663d648f5164bc522e60.poster.avif?t=1795810112\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964490/extras/db5055bc3cdb663d648f5164bc522e60.webm?t=1795810112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964490/extras/db5055bc3cdb663d648f5164bc522e60.mp4?t=1795810112\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build Your Weapon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find attachments and bolt them straight onto your gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine items to find your perfect build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964490/extras/83b05c658641eb4734f17aeba92790f0.poster.avif?t=1795810112\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964490/extras/83b05c658641eb4734f17aeba92790f0.webm?t=1795810112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964490/extras/83b05c658641eb4734f17aeba92790f0.mp4?t=1795810112\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Keep Moving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat is fast and built around movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dash through attacks, slide around and wall-jump around enemies. Staying mobile is key to surviving the increasing threat of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play Alone or With Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or team up online with three friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone can build their own weapon and customise their character to their own liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964490/extras/0b1ace23b5dba232be8048fc159280e1.poster.avif?t=1795810112\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964490/extras/0b1ace23b5dba232be8048fc159280e1.webm?t=1795810112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964490/extras/0b1ace23b5dba232be8048fc159280e1.mp4?t=1795810112\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A New Build Every Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rooms, enemies, rewards, and attachments change each time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work with what you find and turn it into a build strong enough to finish the run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast roguelike shooting for 1\u20134 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online co-op for up to four players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapons assembled from visible attachments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Movement built around dashing, sliding, and wall-jumping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items that combine into powerful builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Changing rooms, enemies, and rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character customisation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A colourful miniature toy world</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Blast through a miniature toy world alone or with up to three friends in a high-speed roguelike shooter. Snap bizarre attachments onto your weapon, master fluid movement, and stack loot until your build becomes unstoppable.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964490/7d771da02d9f4cd1c2a8fe6aab2481d1a3d61ee1/header.jpg?t=1795810112", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Third-Person Shooter", "Action Roguelike", "Co-op", "Multiplayer", "Parkour", "Looter Shooter"], "developers": "Spare Rocket", "publishers": "Spare Rocket", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4964490", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "26 November 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/_BTGTZ_HYMo", "first_seen": 1795647600.0, "review_rank": 13}